# 容器内可执行脚本/配置必须 LF 行尾(CRLF 会导致 shebang 解释器找不到)
docker/entrypoint.sh            text eol=lf
docker/templates/*.tpl          text eol=lf
docker/templates/*.example      text eol=lf
docker/nginx-default.conf       text eol=lf
Dockerfile                      text eol=lf
*.sh                            text eol=lf
